{"4306070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catch Meow If You Can", "steam_appid": 4306070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4973390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >         <strong>Catch Meow if You Can</strong> is a chaotic co-op  survival game where you play as the real owners of the house: the cats. A crew of thieves breaks into your home not for gold, but for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/887c70ac45fd35da55d1a633f3ff0e2e.poster.avif?t=1788205634\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/887c70ac45fd35da55d1a633f3ff0e2e.webm?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/887c70ac45fd35da55d1a633f3ff0e2e.mp4?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/28eca3ede805b296eae3b1b9b165d0eb.webp?t=1788205634\" width=616 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Play solo or with up to 4 friends. Hide in the shadows, squeeze through tight spaces, climb higher floors, and complete objectives to unlock your path upward. Each level forces you to outsmart the thieves as you slip past them and push closer to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/fcca7632a79526cf8ec8170355359a54.poster.avif?t=1788205634\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse