ces you to adapt, rethink your strategy, and use the environment in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/b5b509d96aeed2a97dcd673cac8d6827.poster.avif?t=1788205634\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/b5b509d96aeed2a97dcd673cac8d6827.webm?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/b5b509d96aeed2a97dcd673cac8d6827.mp4?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/415f908a152c55759e7feeebe3391f72.webp?t=1788205634\" width=616 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        Use throwable items together to turn the odds in your favor. Stun and temporarily disable thieves to help your teammates escape, rescue them from danger, or buy valuable time to complete objectives.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/14b92e6d434a9f79cd019667edcaccc5.poster.avif?t=1788205634\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/14b92e6d434a9f79cd019667edcaccc5.webm?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306070/extras/14b92e6d434a9f79cd019667edcaccc5.mp4?t=1788205634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\